# Styling and Coloring the Legend

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:plotly_ex, "~> 0.3"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"}
])
```

## Section

Customize the legend box with `bgcolor`, `bordercolor`, `borderwidth`, and
`font` inside `layout.legend`.

```elixir
alias Plotly.{Figure, Scatter}

Figure.new()
|> Figure.add_trace(Scatter.new(x: [1, 2, 3], y: [2, 4, 3], name: "Alpha", mode: "lines"))
|> Figure.add_trace(Scatter.new(x: [1, 2, 3], y: [3, 1, 4], name: "Beta", mode: "lines"))
|> Figure.update_layout(
  title: "Styled Legend",
  legend: %{
    bgcolor: "#E2E2E2",
    bordercolor: "#FFFFFF",
    borderwidth: 2,
    font: %{family: "Arial", size: 14, color: "black"}
  }
)
|> Plotly.show()
```
